   "qualification": "Gateway Qualifications Level 2 Diploma in Digital and IT Skills",
   "courseForMe": "<p>This IT course is an excellent opportunity for individuals looking to extend and improve their digital skills. The course covers a diverse range of topics that can enhance your knowledge and proficiency in various digital fields. The practical skills and knowledge that you gain from this course can prepare you for a variety of job roles in the digital and creative industries, such as software and programming, network support, and digital design. Moreover, with the increasing demand for digital skills in various sectors ranging from finance, marketing, machining to manufacturing, this qualification can be beneficial for individuals seeking job opportunities in these sectors too. The course is tailored to provide a strong foundation in the digital skills required to excel in the modern workplace, and it is designed to help you keep pace with the rapidly changing digital landscape. Whether you are looking to upskill or reskill, this IT course can help you achieve your goals by providing you with the necessary knowledge and practical skills to succeed in the digital world. With expert guidance and support, you can unlock your potential and develop a strong foundation in digital skills that can help you kickstart your career.</p>",
   "overview": "<p>The qualification includes a mandatory unit and optional units that relate directly to the skills, knowledge and behaviours expected by employers. You will cover a wide range of topics and use different digital technologies, systems, and software. Overall, you will develop knowledge and understanding of the core areas of Digital and an introduction to the skills required in the Digital sector, acting as a good stepping stone into the industry or for further future study.</p><p>We also collaborate with stakeholders, including Sharp, to continually develop our programmes by listening to feedback and ensuring learners gain real-world experience.</p>",
   "employability": "<ul><li>Develop skills at a higher level by moving up the level of qualification from Level 2 to Level 3</li><li>Progress to employment where you can put your digital and IT knowledge and skills into practice.</li></ul>",
